THIRD-PARTY AND DERIVED DATA
----------------------------
Portions of the evidence and reference trees are derived from third-party datasets whose
rights status is recorded per artifact in the modules' `docs/mission.md` and
`docs/capability-profile.json` files, and in
`amphora-source-ledger/reference/mvp20/data/*/catalog.json`.

Those records are not uniformly resolved and must be reviewed before any redistribution or
external use:

  - 125 artifact declarations across the 29 mission documents carry rights status
    UNRESOLVED; 103 of those paths are tracked in this repository.
  - In the source ledger's rights decisions, 16 of 31 sources are NOT
    DERIVATIVE_ALLOWED — including PROHIBITED_BULK (PoLyInfo/MatNavi, Polymer Genome),
    CONTEXT_ONLY (five under the Georgia Tech Research Corporation General Public Use
    License Agreement), CREDENTIALED, and MANUAL_EXPORT categories.
  - All 31 rights decisions currently carry a null decision_receipt.
  - 33 sources are CC-BY-4.0 and therefore require attribution on any redistribution.

No attribution notices have been assembled. Resolving the outstanding rights decisions and
producing a NOTICE file is a prerequisite for distributing any part of this work outside the
owning organisation. See `amphora-ip-fto-guard/` and `amphora-sourceability-ehs/` for the
per-source evidence, and note that freedom-to-operate is a matter for counsel, not for this
repository.
